  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67e3fc02ddc6a296f43eb733",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听好啰，使魔。\r\n主人的比赛，\r\n你从头到尾都要仔细看喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f56820474b80c91d081f6ff986f05c00973b4259166201a38dde2993c69c0ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d5540a43b137e5b8b68c994",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得心情不太畅快……\r\n不过只要比赛的时候\r\n能好好跑就没问题了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccbdb48275896dc9748243ff1e89ddf57271519ac5630a73936b29f12fd4ef63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f2020e53eec0c73a10ce287",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……总觉得状况有点不太好。\r\n喂，你要比平常更努力\r\n替我加油喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b63b2254fb9ff0d483932724abca30425768b104804830767a8ab19a712609fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8370686f2e76c1df90cc64ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天才魔法少女没有办不到的事情！\r\n……没错，今天可能只是\r\n会比较辛苦一点而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5f6c1de655c381235a41ae189e038f00b49bd481223e0db0cb34818f9cd36a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd2f0607734846a2183a2b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜呜～！\r\n我可是天才魔法少女，\r\n我、我会赢啦！一定会的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10cdd30a57494ce6aab2c850b644ca5b95a598d8e4fd8894424d190a5a3cf631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0809602ef8eed7aa46143fe7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你、你干嘛一脸担心的样子！\r\n我就算状态不太好，\r\n也不可能会输啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d7cad8f468b40e350744d0c91ccbd537c3d4026a24b9c8ba786fcbd505ba20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2569ddf742bfbb8ffa64ea71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祖母……我应该没问题吧。\r\n毕竟我努力练习过了。\r\n所以一定……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5be79f950e0508f0380791054381f466eb64eb104c3da56b2676ce8a1991f0d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1afa61d727176d52372d962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a8e24f90cd4cee7b85d86a761229a975aa6276f070c63c399e4666d3e4647c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ee9fd953fde67d3aa5e0f49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真没办法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cd95337f08ec9db4d36e3f5bc896595082cec3e08fb036c1da73120eff3b01e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e73a7ffc11c3c94e6d934a4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38e4ea51f72aee24c895eb666e0b155498a4055f36cc7fcf292d53cf92cb13af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93955b0b464bb7092e2e6e7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2d0320b83f4d5d7adb7e0844006540602b828627571907670b90a799c7bc01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d419f58fa30dd007a8401bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讨厌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b78422d96442c8233083b27a9c29136e1f465168375e3bce24984d9676ce699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d53a478c980e7ba6d9e0c0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6878a171cd7c622ff4ce46652aac560c21f087f2463528166016ac47a0c718e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b071024f595a982561047a32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要走啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2def9cbddf426f2e510518e2aa76acba4dcf13fc1e2188693a59eff56340783c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64cfc608b674818d96891634",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是大海耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9744130060461a3c7c9adb781383da0c45d86b02a79a7f784bfa7b182bed0f38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10bdec6788739ded8cf7c93a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得你努力过了，\r\n所以姑且称赞你一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45e41ed5fdd0443847e8cb8930aad0d967f99609eecd3be4d7e20024d1ecd28b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4cc8490ddf11d97c14bcf99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现得还不错嘛。辛苦你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb179944787bcbfec36de06077db30b20d1cd499ca67b3d6c60820b414fa702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d40e3a02f3a7abd760b27776",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要使出合体魔法啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d3533374be6d6d3b16c08658ee0e15f639d335625e0661f54b8cb50f50502c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1348bbf80b35e9caac3a6457",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识我们的魔法吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93114eadea650eda7ab8c00c254672cfada58aa4046ab1e5713aee6e6cbdc384",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5266c9c21ba22cc89c1eff3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔法少女队，要上场啰──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be7bf8874c1160de184fbe1565bae64e5232b6a2e3a86a1082e30d000ef9e364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:768058f122e30392913e4c7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现得还不错嘛。辛苦你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb179944787bcbfec36de06077db30b20d1cd499ca67b3d6c60820b414fa702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15697c4fd9ec4db8efaadbff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天才魔法少女Sweepy\r\n无论何时都会获胜！\r\n先准备好帮我庆祝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2bc646223a8506da70ad44d527d7502eb7c54e2e306ad78ba37ebaca3ebb18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea5f0169a56df9eaed8b0d64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，感觉真不错♪\r\n今天应该能使出厉害的魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc7e509cfd8b4ebffb3a0a0ffe07c7cce44189d578d923499ea1b7426a97b28c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23360a781a50b2934f20841f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现得还不错嘛。辛苦你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb179944787bcbfec36de06077db30b20d1cd499ca67b3d6c60820b414fa702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a2cc722617af18046b05f10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30018edfb0c3e6d25822efc176770762d5cfe5ec512b78949f6d10d3a4aee7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:becc342d4f09609b090f6c37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讨厌～！\r\n我下次会拿下第一名～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f53c8171fdbf84bdc8e77bb996404679bbf819d1ed443542b41f54689546794",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e3d5b1e13fa80838ad0886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才不会这样就满意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07da77933efeb1c5ba93f8b7142a2e1248ecf1cba4b09ebd1b20d393301f0795",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b5b54f6919f4540de4f20e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只是今天状况不太好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a53d5024c589525144dc9938a574072cb12eb4c076930302d2211548dec14f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62bbb25871b6fe405c53336d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讨厌讨厌！\r\n重新再比一次啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c35bd2aea59ee2f2bf330a633458642211a8a686d65cc8dc209b5cc860dabf6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e48f1b76687b658ac440634",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼！\r\n知道魔女的厉害了吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b22def3a0b78b89eefa49244e62d13f1ab1915d3cd9371b41a48d40dccd0a30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ff3270d9c544283270d7d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，我的表现就像魔法一样吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a22f98ff4ed67de8df193cae3aadb3e0c4eca8189f88ddca3cc0fa3a92641b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:272291b63a5fecd82f26fd28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふん♪まだ、魔法はないって言う？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ea64091c685c5fc4c7b471899a54183cc3533bf1e6457cd3602a4d1013ef5c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f31dff97ac72883f9e18d79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふんっ、マジカルな走りだったでしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf2e173c54a9839eae41ddd545e69dcae8dc559898108fbfe4b80735a7062785",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:835ed5ced4e9ee43397a6025",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3861f23a8a98d8b04faafc68d69d8eec7e3747c08ef2c4efd43811a2aa11bd00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff5fd0d60ef5c136efd9fcec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰，魔力全开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78647b5f0b830873b68407e403498de7a1a58c87de81fef64e8e5ea7193a0c4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5736b8ac2606c0e8859f38d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸一直问我哪天回老家，\r\n真的超啰嗦的！总之，\r\n等年假放完我就会回去看他了啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9516d3074a3a1bfb07f2eaaa40c0795f2b3d43c322dfc4d1b946c388c793a29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:620f14bff0590299c3a76957",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的，每件事都要我费心。\r\n看来除了准备过新年外，\r\n还有很多事情需要我来施魔法呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ce41ff741f1a19286440bcf192874547d3b3fc1c7f801fe068b2b545c0ce84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b9e53df05b8eb4d6bcf31f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞厅里那颗闪亮亮的球，\r\n感觉起来好像有点魔力呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "789dc941ef4c0f280e0197d326dc50cee60f742fedf809708accc5b1da2b8501",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e570057acea0206a8b7c0ce0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どう！？アンタも\r\n使いたくなったんじゃない？\r\n特別な、ワクワクする魔法を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a4596d4953c5251a7f1dacb14e764c76d472c6f8d95a80f0bfd9bd27257289f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9c06c56b7eb98f4956eff19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一闪一闪・亮晶晶……☆\r\n让大家见识最棒的魔法！\r\n乖乖听话啊！嗯……做好觉悟吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3168b117ebd1550fe6d01dfcb9947eb75c02af5ad04a5bffeec766ccdae41f30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d36504f80b1ec914e0a0f21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新しい魔女服、\r\nグランマにい～っぱい\r\nほめてもらうんだから♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cf36a96355a0818e0663032fa9e436c2cf2b4c2257899163fb9a6f3629c9e0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c0bc57e4b12a90cfde9ec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动结束啦？是喔。\r\n是说我应该要来去找祖母，\r\n让她教我怎么用那个魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e2a20171ee57b32d9981c52a3a6150c8d2952aa7f1415b8f166124a8d594c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a663a4b826147e399d8f5079",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とっておきの魔法、見せてあげるっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "502a0e96335e019b390fdd7e1cdb7aa8b12f7cde3a13096a97b414c2a8def43c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ea505346485ee31721faea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やだやだやだ～！かわりなんかないもん！\r\nずっと心に決めたものがあるの！\r\n想い描いてた魔女に、なるんだから…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31d67d9f5c220f36d4beb7fe829a5611e2056ebc37e39e116f46d65bb3843b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551b52609e33c4f76dbf3897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "えっ、ウミネコって猫じゃないの？\r\n…使い魔にしてオーディション\r\n手伝わせようと思ってたのに～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41ea3376a2227802c0071aa16e967b3dd146510a1049829ab1735376a2d72b54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c819a3a2f766b5c63f0137a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一闪一闪・亮晶晶☆\r\n变成一场出色的演唱会吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a45e5db6c44c9be25abfd673d19e588399851884ea1765bf520ef421fc4fc4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc55a11a6e7fd3950f11ca0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要将Sweepy的歌唱魔法，\r\n传达给大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03d031e498dd2eaad4ff55a0aed533d6ac504962005655ffe246fc89dc5de08b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb8359d634fbbfcb2fb9616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会把你当作使魔狠狠使唤的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "538886812da5e8a53085381a544d1edec99e64d7989389027ac362643402a734",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b01373134f6bf6795b8b8cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔法少女果然要有使魔！\r\n你以后也要一直为我效力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "479ef88674d8a757e400bed14121faddca1b26507e667ed18a4d565ce345806d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b87212f92bd20d226ef3672",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服穿起来也不错呢。\r\n魔法少女需要有一个伪装的身份♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d81c95c54c048f5c0a3a6d322163a25eecc8aecf958840e4f25fb28ed9d3e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93115ab1f697a6a57ed969a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件轻飘飘的衣服很有魔法少女的\r\n感觉吧！帽子也很搭，我很喜欢呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24eadd01d0e7ed09385316e4e314e595c719f93e7b1cf8c26c208a4dbae5a677",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24d77dba2ef3017c03920d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论怎么看我都是魔法少女对吧？\r\n不管什么对手都会被我用魔法秒杀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b89d104f0d8f22029076fef8dfdc89b11c7c55130d4b0b6eba83970065630f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d27c90f1ca7c15ec5aa6586c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～果然还是觉得少了什么！\r\n我想再披一件帅气的披风！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3c4202b4b6f95720fa274b5ef32ca07766b8e9ba70ff76524c78f371a385d7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73c491a865c6de9b823d7bf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咏唱让自己变闪耀的咒语……\r\n然后，用唱歌和跳舞让人迷上我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4592d98316f051bb25f94edcab4f04ecf921314d7cff94eadca5e65766842683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dac51c6920fb149a38a24d58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服上施展了最强的魔法♪\r\n无论何时都能为Sweepy带来勇气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5da7634bf7068b1d637ef3593c985e70afddc5cb05cf657d9fd7c932906cc959",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8427c1fa02df112842a61599",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ♪スイーピーにうっとりしちゃった？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28ab87d3e89720d31d702c951c7df101382b54645f9534e799534113715b4870",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f322986ce31a23274b82c262",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もー！早くほめないと怒るわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a7a214af7412c0ea92788b2251aea407e573ddc30fff10c9aaa423b06fcf7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:771c912e5fdd261698060638",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一闪一闪・亮晶晶☆\r\nSweepy变身！怎么样？很可爱吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9306c15c6e7ec1f11b98feddaee004e35996a180f97dd4a30269422a77572db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1248f7e6189439eee91325",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚点传衣服的照片给祖母看吧！\r\n她一定会不断称赞我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fef05a177b25af935da8eba2d0ddce0c4d20265575b2a13c7eb82c0fb326113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ee03307e23b0c8b777f741",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔力を溜めるにはこの服がいいのよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "570d41b065c44f8e0e839001bc4f19f60afad9769c1aa27569d4ce06cc9f0921",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce77a2cc360ebb8bffc98a06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使い魔ならアタシを見習って、\r\n服にも気を使いなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58164639f327895cae934ff2dd501e0e7d50a13fd73fa90a32d9eabeaed71140",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
